    "description": {
      "value": "<p>如果你拥有施法或契约魔法职业能力，医疗龙纹表中的法术将加入你施法职业的法术列表中。</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:292px;height:120px\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:66.00pt\"></col> <col style=\"width:119.25pt\"></col> </colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et2\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">法术环位</td>\n<td class=\"et2\" style=\"width:203px;height:20px\">法术</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">1</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:203px;height:20px\">疗伤术，治愈真言。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">2</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:203px;height:20px\">次级复原术，治疗祷言。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">3</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:203px;height:20px\">活力灵光，群体治愈真言。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">4</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:203px;height:20px\">净化灵光，生命灵光。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:20px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:20px;width:87px\">5</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:203px;height:20px\">高级复原术。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
